---
// Shopify Distributed Call Timeout Budget Hierarchy Diagram Component
---

<figure class="spt-diag" aria-labelledby="spt-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="spt-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 180"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="spt-diag-title spt-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="spt-diag-title">
      分散式呼叫階層式逾時預算（Timeout Budget Hierarchy）圖
    </title>
    <desc id="spt-diag-desc">
      展示客戶端/閘道 Timeout 5.0s 大於內部支付服務 Timeout 3.5s 大於第三方銀行
      API Timeout 2.0s 的嚴格遞減階層。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="spt-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="spt-diag__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="150"
      rx="12"
      class="spt-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Node 1: Gateway (x: 45, width: 235) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 30)">
      <rect
        width="235"
        height="100"
        rx="8"
        class="spt-diag__box spt-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="28"
        class="spt-diag__title spt-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        1. 客戶端 / API 閘道
      </text>
      <text x="117" y="52" class="spt-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        入口端全域等待上限
      </text>
      <rect
        x="20"
        y="64"
        width="195"
        height="24"
        rx="4"
        class="spt-diag__pill spt-diag__pill--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="80"
        class="spt-diag__pill-text spt-diag__pill-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        Timeout 預算: 5.0s
      </text>
    </g>

    <path
      d="M 285 80 L 320 80"
      class="spt-diag__path"
      marker-end="url(#spt-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Node 2: Payment Service (x: 325, width: 235) -->
    <g transform="translate(325, 30)">
      <rect
        width="235"
        height="100"
        rx="8"
        class="spt-diag__box spt-diag__box--amber"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="28"
        class="spt-diag__title spt-diag__title--amber"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2. 內部支付微服務
      </text>
      <text x="117" y="52" class="spt-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        核心業務中台處理預算
      </text>
      <rect
        x="20"
        y="64"
        width="195"
        height="24"
        rx="4"
        class="spt-diag__pill spt-diag__pill--amber"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="80"
        class="spt-diag__pill-text spt-diag__pill-text--amber"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        Timeout 預算: 3.5s
      </text>
    </g>

    <path
      d="M 565 80 L 600 80"
      class="spt-diag__path"
      marker-end="url(#spt-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Node 3: Bank API (x: 605, width: 230) -->
    <g transform="translate(605, 30)">
      <rect
        width="230"
        height="100"
        rx="8"
        class="spt-diag__box spt-diag__box--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="115"
        y="28"
        class="spt-diag__title spt-diag__title--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        3. 第三方銀行 API
      </text>
      <text x="115" y="52" class="spt-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        底層收單渠道通訊超時
      </text>
      <rect
        x="18"
        y="64"
        width="194"
        height="24"
        rx="4"
        class="spt-diag__pill spt-diag__pill--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="115"
        y="80"
        class="spt-diag__pill-text spt-diag__pill-text--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        Timeout 預算: 2.0s
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="spt-diag__mobile">
    <div class="spt-mobile-card spt-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="spt-mobile-badge spt-mobile-badge--green"
        >GATEWAY BUDGET: 5.0s</span
      >
      <h4>1. 客戶端 / API 閘道</h4>
      <p>
        最外層客戶端與網關設定 5.0
        秒最大超時限制，保留足夠餘裕等待內層邏輯完成。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="spt-mobile-arrow">▼ 必須嚴格大於下游（留緩衝時間）</div>

    <div class="spt-mobile-card spt-mobile-card--amber">
      <span class="spt-mobile-badge spt-mobile-badge--amber"
        >SERVICE BUDGET: 3.5s</span
      >
      <h4>2. 內部支付微服務</h4>
      <p>
        中台服務設定 3.5 秒超時，留出 1.5 秒處理結果封裝、風控更新與重試記錄。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="spt-mobile-arrow">▼ 必須嚴格大於外部渠道</div>

    <div class="spt-mobile-card spt-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="spt-mobile-badge spt-mobile-badge--red"
        >BANK API BUDGET: 2.0s</span
      >
      <h4>3. 第三方銀行 / 渠道 API</h4>
      <p>
        底層對外 HTTP 請求嚴格限制 2.0 秒熔斷。若 2.0
        秒未響應立即斷開並發起狀態查詢，絕不讓上游先於下游超時造成狀態幽靈脫節！
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="spt-diag-caption" class="spt-diag__caption">
    圖二：分散式服務呼叫階層式逾時預算（Timeout Budget Hierarchy）防脫節架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .spt-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .spt-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .spt-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .spt-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .spt-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .spt-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .spt-diag__box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .spt-diag__box--amber {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #292316);
    stroke: #d29922;
  }

  .spt-diag__box--red {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #2d1d24);
    stroke: #da3633;
  }

  .spt-diag__title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .spt-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .spt-diag__title--amber {
    fill: #e3b341;
  }

  .spt-diag__title--red {
    fill: #f85149;
  }

  .spt-diag__desc {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .spt-diag__pill {
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .spt-diag__pill--green {
    fill: #1b2e23;
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .spt-diag__pill--amber {
    fill: #292316;
    stroke: #d29922;
  }

  .spt-diag__pill--red {
    fill: #2d1d24;
    stroke: #da3633;
  }

  .spt-diag__pill-text {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .spt-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .spt-diag__pill-text--amber {
    fill: #e3b341;
  }

  .spt-diag__pill-text--red {
    fill: #f85149;
  }

  .spt-diag__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong, #58a6ff);
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .spt-diag__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong, #58a6ff);
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__box--amber {
    fill: #fff8c5;
    stroke: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__box--red {
    fill: #ffebe9;
    stroke: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__title--amber {
    fill: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__title--red {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__pill--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__pill--amber {
    fill: #fff8c5;
    stroke: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__pill--red {
    fill: #ffebe9;
    stroke: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__pill-text--amber {
    fill: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__pill-text--red {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__path {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spt-diag__arrow-head {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .spt-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .spt-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .spt-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .spt-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .spt-mobile-card--amber {
      border-color: #d29922;
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.05);
    }

    .spt-mobile-card--red {
      border-color: #da3633;
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.05);
    }

    .spt-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .spt-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .spt-mobile-badge--amber {
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.2);
      color: #e3b341;
    }

    .spt-mobile-badge--red {
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.2);
      color: #f85149;
    }

    .spt-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .spt-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }

    .spt-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    }
  }
</style>
